  "content": "\n\n<h1>DarkGlint</h1>\n<p><strong>遊戲說明</strong></p>\n<p>將原版附魔光澤更換為更深藍色的星雲光澤&nbsp;<em><br></em></p>\n<p><em>僅供客戶端使用</em></p>\n<p>由製作 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 的同一團隊開發（欲獲得完整的 RPG 體驗，請下載 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">《DarkRPG》整合包</a>，享受豐富的任務與 RPG 玩法）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<h5>（這些功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗）</h5>\n<h5>此模組將您原本的原版附魔物品與盔甲光澤，改為酷炫的深藍色星雲光澤，在暗處視覺效果極佳！建議前往「無障礙設定」將「光澤強度」調至 100%，以獲得最佳效果。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/989/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/977557893110964374/1135933208790323310/javaw_Tr5W8rud3d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"&quot;458\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/990/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器，與好友同樂！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></p>",
